== Reward ==

<ul><li>  Experience, faction
</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

Unsar Koldhagon may be found in the Hall of Sorcery (285, -655).  You may get this quest at '''dubious''' [[Order of Three]] faction.

You say, 'Hail, Unsar Koldhagon'

: [[Unsar Koldhagon]] says 'Hello, ______, I am Unsar, student of Mespha. I am working on a spell. . . I call it [Unsar's Glory]. Great name, huh?'

You say, 'What is Unsar's Glory?'

: Unsar Koldhagon says 'Ah, Unsar's Glory. . . Mind you, I haven't perfected it yet, but bring me some '''[[Rat Whiskers]], [[Snake Scales]], and two [[Bat Wing]]s''', and I'll show you how it works.'

The items are common drops from the mobs in the newbie yard outside the North Gate.  Hand them in.

: Unsar Koldhagon says 'Thanks, but remember, I need all four items to show you the spell.'
: Unsar Koldhagon says 'All right, check this out. . . Maybe one day you'll be good enough to do this, too.'

(Unsar casts a buff on himself.)

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Order of Three]] got better. +5
* Your faction standing with [[Bloodsabers]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Guards of Qeynos]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Opal Dark Briar]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

Note: It only took a single turn in, as a Wood Elf druid, to go from dubious to apprehensive. Very handy as all of the vendors in the caster area are on this faction (Order of Three). As of 4/19/2020 confirmed +5 to Order of Three.

You can also buy all 3 of these items from merchants.
* [[Rat Whiskers]] from {{Loc|Kithicor Forest|(-216,3813)|Jeena Firechaser - Kithicor Forest}}
* [[Bat Wing]]s from {{Loc|Kithicor Forest|(-216,3813|Jeena Firechaser - Kithicor Forest}}
* [[Snake Scales]] from {{Loc|East Commonlands|(-125,-760)|Pardor the Blessed - East Commonlands}}

